  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Women Entrepreneurs (AWE) - - Incubateur resaeux et entreprise africaine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant is about : .TRAINING AND CAPACITY BUILDING: They give virtual and face-to-face training and capacity building in machine and agricultural technology, accessible to farmers, companies and agricultural associations, but also actors in agri-food processing..AGRICULTURE MECHANIZATION SERVICES:They help in setting up modern agriculture businesses and facilitate the acquisition of agricultural machinery and technology for farmers, companies and agricultural associations, but also actors in agri-food processing..RESEARCH: Yhey also develop agricultural development programs and market studies for local and international companies and agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
